    88	class HandlerEntry(Generic[LifespanResultT]):
    89	    """A registered handler and the params model to validate incoming params against.
    90	
    91	    Stored in `Server._request_handlers` / `_notification_handlers` and consumed
    92	    by `ServerRunner` to validate, build `Context`, and invoke. The handler's
    93	    second-argument type is erased to `Any` in storage (each entry has a
    94	    different concrete params type and `Callable` parameters are contravariant);
    95	    the precise type is recoverable via `params_type`. The correlation is
    96	    enforced at registration time by `Server.add_request_handler`.
